WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.441 --> 00:00:14.421
landed on a sidewalk.

2
00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:16.903
"Where am I?"

3
00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:18.403
She looked around.

4
00:00:19.284 --> 00:00:20.704
None of the signs were in English.

5
00:00:22.065 --> 00:00:23.826
Roxy checked the GPS on her watch.

6
00:00:24.766 --> 00:00:25.266
She gulped.

7
00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:28.748
"I'm on the other side of the world!

8
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.762
I have to get back to Metro City before Vic Nebula disappears!"

9
00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:37.524
Roxy used her super rocket speed and shot into the air.

10
00:00:38.345 --> 00:00:41.746
Boom! Her speed created a sonic boom that shook buildings.

11
00:00:42.527 --> 00:00:43.567
Roxy gritted her teeth.

12
00:00:44.568 --> 00:00:46.429
She flew over the clouds and into space.

13
00:00:50.391 --> 00:00:53.193
She passed over the North Pole and then headed back down to Earth.

14
00:00:54.593 --> 00:00:58.075
Lakes, fields, mountains, and cities flashed by below her.

15
00:00:59.776 --> 00:01:00.636
"Yes!" Roxy cried.

16
00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:02.557
"There's Metro City!"

17
00:01:03.957 --> 00:01:07.858
As Roxy raced toward Metro City University, she used her x-ray vision.

18
00:01:09.359 --> 00:01:11.759
She saw Vic Nebula holding bundles of money.

19
00:01:12.419 --> 00:01:14.700
The scientist was about to step into a wormhole!

20
00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:19.581
Zoom! Roxy smashed through the wall of the lab.

21
00:01:20.502 --> 00:01:22.942
She slammed into Vic and knocked her away from the wormhole.

22
00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:25.283
"Gah!" Vic tried to run away.

23
00:01:25.923 --> 00:01:27.203
Roxy grabbed the villain's arm.

24
00:01:27.904 --> 00:01:28.924
Vic swung her arm away.

25
00:01:30.068 --> 00:01:32.269
Roxy's fingers hit buttons on the wormhole device.

26
00:01:33.289 --> 00:01:35.910
Suddenly dozens of wormholes popped open in the lab!

27
00:01:37.171 --> 00:01:38.291
Roxy leaped toward Vic.

28
00:01:39.192 --> 00:01:41.993
They tumbled through a wormhole and landed in downtown Metro City.

29
00:01:45.534 --> 00:01:47.535
Vic tried to push Roxy through another wormhole.

30
00:01:48.055 --> 00:01:50.196
Roxy grabbed her, and they fell through together.

31
00:01:51.437 --> 00:01:53.878
This time they landed in the computer center at school.

32
00:01:55.258 --> 00:01:56.139
"Rocket Girl!"

33
00:01:56.439 --> 00:01:57.079
Mara cried.

34
00:01:59.364 --> 00:02:01.506
"Grr!" Roxy tried again to steal the wormhole device.

35
00:02:02.266 --> 00:02:05.488
Crash! She and Vic knocked over chairs as they fought.

36
00:02:06.189 --> 00:02:08.971
They fell into another wormhole and were back in Vic's lab.

37
00:02:12.213 --> 00:02:14.455
Roxy fired her eye laser beams at the device.

38
00:02:14.475 --> 00:02:17.137
"Ouch!" Vic cried.

39
00:02:17.697 --> 00:02:19.058
The device fell from her hand.

40
00:02:19.719 --> 00:02:21.740
She stumbled backward and fell into a wormhole.

41
00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:23.501
The device hit the floor.

42
00:02:24.182 --> 00:02:27.024
Crack! Instantly all the wormholes vanished.

43
00:02:28.588 --> 00:02:29.448
Vic was gone too.

44
00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:33.950
Roxy picked up the broken device.

45
00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.992
"Vic can't come back without this.

46
00:02:37.692 --> 00:02:38.992
I wonder where she is now."

47
00:02:39.953 --> 00:02:40.933
She looked around the lab.

48
00:02:40.953 --> 00:02:43.294
"At least she didn't get away with the money!"

49
00:02:47.856 --> 00:02:49.877
Roxy returned to the computer center at school.

50
00:02:54.359 --> 00:02:56.359
Vic Nebula help you catch the villain?"

51
00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:57.480
Terrell whispered.

52
00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.341
Roxy shook her head.

53
00:02:59.361 --> 00:03:02.164
"Vic Nebula was the villain.

54
00:03:03.065 --> 00:03:05.948
She got away, but she'll never come back."

55
00:03:06.269 --> 00:03:07.009
Roxy shrugged.

56
00:03:07.029 --> 00:03:11.014
"At least I have a new idea for my research project."

57
00:03:11.034 --> 00:03:12.375
"What's that?"

58
00:03:12.615 --> 00:03:13.336
Terrell asked.

59
00:03:13.356 --> 00:03:16.860
"Wormholes!" Roxy grinned.
